---
import { PreviewNavbar } from '../components/layout/PreviewNavbar';
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>About v2 - Creative</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased overflow-x-hidden">`n  <PreviewNavbar client:load variationName="Creative v2" />
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-[-1] bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-fuchsia-300/40 via-purple-300/20 to-transparent"></div>
  <div class="fixed inset-0 z-[-1] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_bottom_left,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-blue-300/40 via-teal-300/20 to-transparent"></div>

  <main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-32">
    <div class="relative z-10 mb-40">
      <h1 class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-8">
        Design with <br/><span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-600 to-blue-500">intent.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-slate-600 max-w-2xl font-light">
        We create digital spaces that command attention. Pragmatic design met with technical precision.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 mb-40 items-center">
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-1">
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-6">Visual communication.</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 mb-8">
          Aesthetics serve function. We build interfaces that guide users naturally, removing friction while maintaining distinct visual character.
        </p>
        <a href="#" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-medium text-purple-600 hover:text-purple-700 transition-colors group">
          View our work 
          <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform">→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7 relative group">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-tr from-purple-500 to-blue-500 rounded-3xl blur-2xl opacity-20 group-hover:opacity-40 transition-opacity duration-500"></div>
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1618005182384-a83a8bd57fbe?q=80&w=2564&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Abstract design" class="relative rounded-3xl w-full h-[600px] object-cover shadow-2xl transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-[1.02]" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-lg shadow-purple-900/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Strategy</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Defining the core objective before placing a single pixel. We align design decisions with business outcomes.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-lg shadow-blue-900/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300 lg:translate-y-12">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Identity</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Establishing visual systems that scale. Consistency across all touchpoints, from marketing to product.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-white/60 backdrop-blur-xl p-10 rounded-3xl border border-white/20 shadow-lg shadow-teal-900/5 hover:-translate-y-2 transition-transform duration-300">
        <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Development</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600">Performant execution. We ensure the final product matches the design intent without compromising speed.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>


